==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|kenely}}, {{m|enm|kenliche}}, from {{inh|en|ang|cēnlīċe|t=keenly, boldly, courageously}}, equivalent to {{af|en|keen|-ly|id2=adverbial}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|köinlik|t=boldly}}, archaic {{cog|de|kühnlich|t=bravely}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkiːnli/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-keenly.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{hyph|en|keen|ly}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[keen]] manner.
#: {{ux|en|watch something '''keenly'''}}
#: {{ux|en|We played '''keenly'''.}}

